      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَكَدًا لَهُ وجَحَدًا</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">له وجُحْدُا</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُكْدًا</span></b> , [<i>May
